 reative Work Fund\, the National Endowment for the Arts\, the Lila Wallac
 e Foundation\, and the San Francisco Arts Commission. Wallace has perform
 ed\, recorded\, and studied with many acknowledged masters of the Afro-La
 tin and jazz idioms\, such as Aretha Franklin\, Bobby Hutcherson\, Earth 
